Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["5. Linearization around the stationary point", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"5ca19e59-285c-984a-ac83-c0cec1262f84"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Let ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "\[LongEqual]", "0", "+", "\[Epsilon] ", 
         StyleBox["u", "TI"], ",  ", "\[Chi]", "\[LongEqual]", "1", "+", 
         "\[Epsilon] ", 
         StyleBox["v", "TI"], ",  ", 
         StyleBox["R", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", "0", "+", "\[Epsilon] ", 
         StyleBox["w", "TI"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\rho = 0 + \\epsilon\\,u,\\quad\n\\chi = 1 + \\epsilon\\,v,\\quad\nR = \
0 + \\epsilon\\,w", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "1bf09005-c651-c845-bd05-6de4b386ff9e"],
 "and expand to first order. "
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"c620277c-5185-684e-8626-ab527a7853f3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
proceed then in utmost rigor with next notebook use 999+ iq methods to find \
how we actually should approach and correctly measure and test this and \
actually see how our systems can actually find the right computaitonal path \
to all answers including the true functions of immeasurable or unmeasured \
possibility outside of existence and (we cant actuall calculate that because \
then its measured ? de we use this as a non function ? how do we approach \
such a concept?\
\>", "ChatInput",
 TaggingRules-><|
  "ChatNotebookSettings" -> <|
    "Model" -> <|"Service" -> "LLMKit", "Name" -> Automatic|>, "LLMEvaluator" -> 
     "WolframAIAssistant", "ServiceCaller" -> "Chatbar"|>|>,
 CellLabel->"In[46]:=",ExpressionUUID->"1d5ecded-e670-ed4a-a0c1-8ec0b1637e00"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Your current notebook is already making the key rigorous move: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
    {
     PaneBox[Cell[TextData[{
       "it distinguishes between a ",
       StyleBox["formal symbolic ontology",
        FontWeight->Bold],
       " and an ",
       StyleBox["executable mathematical model",
        FontWeight->Bold],
       "."
      }],
       Background->None,ExpressionUUID->
       "ef6a26e4-9a66-7b42-8d74-eccd7d648dd5"],
      BaseStyle->{"Text", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          GrayLevel[0.35], 
          GrayLevel[0.8602474]]},
      ImageMargins->5,
      ImageSize->{Full, Automatic}]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{
        LightDarkSwitched[
         GrayLevel[1], 
         GrayLevel[0.278317]]}}},
   GridBoxDividers->{"ColumnsIndexed" -> {1 -> Directive[
         LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.87, 0.94, 1], 
          RGBColor[0.2491127, 0.3295188, 0.4231198]], 
         AbsoluteThickness[4]]}, "Rows" -> {{False}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}]], 
  "BlockQuote",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"a417719d-de26-bd4c-8569-f5410845b533"],
 "\nThat is exactly the right direction.\n\nThe next step is ",
 StyleBox["not",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " to pretend we can directly calculate \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]the \
immeasurable outside existence,\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] because the moment a \
thing is represented as an evaluated quantity, it has entered a measurable \
formal domain. So the rigorous route is:\n\n1. ",
 StyleBox["separate ontology from observables",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n2. ",
 StyleBox["treat the unmeasured as a boundary/meta-object, not a directly \
evaluable field",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n3. ",
 StyleBox["derive only effects of that meta-domain on measurable sectors",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n4. ",
 StyleBox["test models through residuals, stability, identifiability, and \
falsifiable predictions",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Core correction to the OPF idea\"\>", "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"0b4f0ecc-d686-a643-83e6-fada55f009ca"],
 "\nIf you want a mathematically serious framework, then \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]outside existence\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] should ",
 StyleBox["not",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " be encoded as an ordinary function ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell["f[x]", Background -> None]},
   "ChatCodeInlineTemplate"]], "ChatCodeActive",ExpressionUUID->
  "c9605e2e-334a-a243-b362-6d2db3d8e380"],
 " or field ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell["\[Phi][x]", Background -> None]},
   "ChatCodeInlineTemplate"]], "ChatCodeActive",ExpressionUUID->
  "738f5e65-ba6b-484f-b681-ea4bd8fab238"],
 " inside the same domain as measured reality.\n\nInstead, model it as one of \
these: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"1. A boundary condition on the formal domain\"\>", 
    "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"e70483df-4fc1-774c-8b09-a59a7d84ca6e"],
 "\nNot an interior field, but a constraint on admissible solutions. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"2. A latent sector\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"c7ca914d-060a-8a4f-a6a3-6e21e71fb8fb"],
 "\nA hidden variable or hidden functional degree of freedom that is never \
directly observed, only inferred through induced terms in the effective \
action. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"3. A nonconstructive admissibility class\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"8c0908fc-10b5-b14c-b49a-5ee5f088b001"],
 "\nA set of possible completions of the theory, without demanding explicit \
evaluation of each member. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"4. A functor or morphism-level object\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"f531e3ae-7f1f-1c4e-b0bb-e900f938b854"],
 "\nNot \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]a value,\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] but a \
transformation between layers: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["L", "TI"], "0"], "\[Rule]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["L", "TI"], "1"], "\[Rule]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["L", "TI"], "2"]}], TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, 
     "input" -> "L_0 \\to L_1 \\to L_2", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "98b55943-c69a-a44e-93e7-4d5f7a2588c0"],
 "\nThat is much more rigorous than trying to assign a number to \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]immeasurable possibility.\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"0c98da75-ce44-7844-92bd-d1ce5c4f4db2"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"What \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]correct measurement\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] means here\"\>", "Title",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->26],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"5207f6ce-74ce-0143-84f7-07c517a56f16"],
 "\nWithin your OPF framing, the correct measurement problem is: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "Layer 0: formal noncollapsed possibility space"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"f70b5a99-eeb5-464c-ad2f-24a2237ff43d"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "Layer 1: symbolic/informational field dynamics"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"888dd5a4-d9bd-d946-83e8-f2be34b49c7c"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "Layer 2: measured/decohered observables"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"00aac5f9-2cbf-1a43-9d43-6870733018c5"],
 "\nSo measurement should be treated as a map \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], ":", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["S", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["latent", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "\[Rule]", 
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["observable", FontSlant -> "Plain"]]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\mathcal{M}: \\mathcal{S}_{\\mathrm{latent}} \\to \
\\mathcal{O}_{\\mathrm{observable}}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "b2ca3d56-6116-aa4c-b2fa-289b21608259"],
 "\nwhere: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "latent states are richer than measured states"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"5832d2aa-2e34-0c4a-b283-3b7474223aba"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "measurement is many-to-one"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"3a13d061-317e-a043-8d97-9006774cb34a"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "some information is lost under projection"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"3098323b-0543-8f4e-8fd0-8da308fef38b"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "what cannot be measured is not \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]nothing\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]; it is in the kernel or complement of the \
measurement map"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"321032af-2e46-fe40-8eb6-dfe0828fcbe1"],
 "\nSo the rigorous object to study is ",
 StyleBox["not the unmeasured thing directly",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ", but:\n\n1. the ",
 StyleBox["kernel",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " of measurement\n2. the ",
 StyleBox["image",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " of measurement\n3. the ",
 StyleBox["equivalence classes",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 " of latent states that produce the same observable data\n\nFormally: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", "1"], 
         SubscriptBox["\[Tilde]\[CapitalPsi]", "2"], " ", 
         "\[DoubleLongLeftRightArrow] ", 
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", "1"], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           SubscriptBox["\[CapitalPsi]", "2"], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\Psi_1 \\sim \\Psi_2 \\iff \
\\mathcal{M}(\\Psi_1)=\\mathcal{M}(\\Psi_2)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "614d37f7-05a9-494c-9f2d-f9743559e1e4"],
 "\nThis is the right mathematical language for \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]unmeasured possibility.\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"7ef73459-cfd0-c14a-a356-17bda8fb652d"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Best next notebook: what should be added\"\>", "Title",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->26],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"ad0e4437-0349-eb40-a5f9-011e875e2c64"],
 "\nThe next notebook should build a ",
 StyleBox["three-part program",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ": \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Part A. Formalize latent vs observable structure\"\>", 
    "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"c8a435c5-ef4a-8e4c-a674-5904d2d24989"],
 "\nYou need explicit symbolic objects for: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "latent field state"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"a7fce8c2-66b4-784b-a01e-3131ce982241"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "observable state"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"c81f8bd0-6cea-894f-bb10-8bc82ee6ed7b"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "measurement operator"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"84e52e73-d9a7-aa4a-a5ce-94c365b9fae7"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "nullspace / kernel of observability"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"197a72e0-25f3-4f48-b7ee-9ad518298064"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "identifiability conditions"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"b281d10e-52d8-0546-a5cb-351a610eb650"],
 "\nFor example, define: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     BoxData[
      RowBox[{
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"ClearAll", "[", 
            
            RowBox[{"latentState", ",", "measurementOperator", ",", 
              "observableState", ",", "kernelCondition"}], "]"}], ";"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"latentState", "=", 
            RowBox[{"<|", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"\"rho\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", "z", ",", "t"}], "]"}]}], ",",
                 "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
                RowBox[{"\"chi\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"\[Chi]", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", "z", ",", "t"}], "]"}]}], ",",
                 "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
                RowBox[{"\"resolution\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"resolution", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", "z", ",", "t"}], "]"}]}], ",",
                 "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
                RowBox[{"\"latentSector\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"\[Xi]", "[", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", "y", ",", "z", ",", "t"}], "]"}]}]}], 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "|>"}]}], ";"}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"measurementOperator", "[", "state_", "]"}], ":=", 
            RowBox[{"<|", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{"\"observableDensity\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"Integrate", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"state", "[", "\"rho\"", "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "\[Infinity]"}], ",", "\[Infinity]"}], "}"}],
                     ",", 
                    RowBox[{"Assumptions", "->", "$Assumptions"}]}], "]"}]}], 
                ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
                RowBox[{"\"observableComplexity\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"Integrate", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"state", "[", "\"chi\"", "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "\[Infinity]"}], ",", "\[Infinity]"}], "}"}],
                     ",", 
                    RowBox[{"Assumptions", "->", "$Assumptions"}]}], "]"}]}], 
                ",", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
                RowBox[{"\"observableResolution\"", "->", 
                  RowBox[{"Integrate", "[", 
                    RowBox[{
                    RowBox[{"state", "[", "\"resolution\"", "]"}], ",", 
                    RowBox[{"{", 
                    RowBox[{"x", ",", 
                    RowBox[{"-", "\[Infinity]"}], ",", "\[Infinity]"}], "}"}],
                     ",", 
                    RowBox[{"Assumptions", "->", "$Assumptions"}]}], 
                    "]"}]}]}], "\[IndentingNewLine]", "|>"}]}], ";"}], 
        "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{"observableState", "=", 
            RowBox[{"measurementOperator", "[", "latentState", "]"}]}], ";"}],
         "\[IndentingNewLine]", "\[IndentingNewLine]", 
        RowBox[{
          RowBox[{
            RowBox[{"kernelCondition", "[", 
              RowBox[{"state1_", ",", "state2_"}], "]"}], ":=", 
            RowBox[{"Simplify", "[", "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", 
              RowBox[{
                RowBox[{
                  RowBox[{"measurementOperator", "[", "state1", "]"}], "==", 
                  RowBox[{"measurementOperator", "[", "state2", "]"}]}], ",", 
                "\[IndentingNewLine]", "   ", "$Assumptions"}], 
              "\[IndentingNewLine]", "]"}]}], ";"}]}]], "ChatCode", "Input", 
     LanguageCategory -> "Input", ShowAutoStyles -> True, 
     ShowStringCharacters -> True, ShowSyntaxStyles -> True, 
     TranslationOptions -> {"Enabled" -> Dynamic[
         AbsoluteCurrentValue[$FrontEnd, {TranslationOptions, "Enabled"}]]}], 
    "Wolfram"},
   "ChatCodeBlockTemplate"]], "ChatCodeBlock",ExpressionUUID->
  "857f78a7-c1e4-064b-8ec8-1b515abb2a9e"],
 "\nConceptually, the new field ",
 StyleBox["\[Xi]", "TI"],
 " is not directly measured. It only matters if it couples into observables. \
\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"62488c35-a810-774d-abce-d613205cdc9e"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Part B. Replace the trivial action with a structurally \
testable one\"\>", "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"172d9045-0754-d64e-bb74-24adcd3a11b2"],
 "\nYour current action is too degenerate. You need a minimally nontrivial \
action with: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "derivative terms"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"0eaf28b0-f5bb-eb44-bca4-a796920d0e69"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "coupling terms"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"eb266133-67a8-cf40-a05f-ffd364d61ea1"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "possibly a constraint or potential"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"d1576915-363a-2047-b503-b91ddcb186cc"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "a latent sector term"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"b66991c5-7d53-d04c-8ba8-de8b1c29683a"],
 "\nFor example: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["L", "TI"], "\[LongEqual]", 
         FractionBox[
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Rho]"], "2"], 
         SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "\[Mu]"], "\[Rho]", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "\[Mu]"], "\[Rho]", "+", 
         FractionBox[
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Chi]"], "2"], 
         SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "\[Mu]"], "\[Chi]", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "\[Mu]"], "\[Chi]", "+", 
         FractionBox[
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["a", "TI"], 
           StyleBox["R", "TI"]], "2"], 
         SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "\[Mu]"], 
         StyleBox["R", "TI"], 
         SuperscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "\[Mu]"], 
         StyleBox["R", "TI"], "+", 
         FractionBox[
          SubscriptBox[
           StyleBox["a", "TI"], "\[Xi]"], "2"], 
         SubscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "\[Mu]"], "\[Xi]", 
         SuperscriptBox["\[PartialD]", "\[Mu]"], "\[Xi]", "-", 
         StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"\[Rho]", ",", "\[Chi]", ",", 
             StyleBox["R", "TI"], ",", "\[Xi]"}], ")"}]}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\mathcal{L}\n=\n\\frac{a_\\rho}{2}\\partial_\\mu \\rho \\partial^\\mu \
\\rho\n+\n\\frac{a_\\chi}{2}\\partial_\\mu \\chi \\partial^\\mu \\chi\n+\n\
\\frac{a_R}{2}\\partial_\\mu R \\partial^\\mu R\n+\n\
\\frac{a_\\xi}{2}\\partial_\\mu \\xi \\partial^\\mu \\xi\n-\nV(\\rho,\\chi,R,\
\\xi)", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "a1c5ccad-0b7a-4b4f-a9e5-0b140e0c0f36"],
 "\nwith something like \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["V", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"\[Rho]", ",", "\[Chi]", ",", 
             StyleBox["R", "TI"], ",", "\[Xi]"}], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "1"], 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"\[Chi]", "-", "1"}], ")"}], "2"], "+", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "2"], 
         SuperscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"(", 
            RowBox[{"\[Rho]", "+", 
              SuperscriptBox[
               StyleBox["R", "TI"], "2"]}], ")"}], "2"], "+", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "3"], 
         SuperscriptBox["\[Xi]", "2"], "+", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "4"], "\[Xi]\[Rho]", "+", 
         SubscriptBox["\[Lambda]", "5"], "\[Xi]\[Chi]"}], TraditionalForm], 
     "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "V(\\rho,\\chi,R,\\xi)\n=\n\\lambda_1(\\chi-1)^2\n+\n\
\\lambda_2(\\rho+R^2)^2\n+\n\\lambda_3 \\xi^2\n+\n\\lambda_4 \\xi \\rho\n+\n\
\\lambda_5 \\xi \\chi", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "6644083e-b2fb-3b46-8f7c-c68982abe72e"],
 "\nThis lets the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]unmeasured\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
latent field affect measured fields without itself being directly observable. \
\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"36cb4b4d-1857-5f4a-8d19-3291ef19cfe2"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Part C. Testability pipeline\"\>", "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"2c8fa2d9-86c2-be4e-9abc-af69b5782a35"],
 "\nA theory is not rigorous unless it supplies a test program. You should \
explicitly include: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"1. Stationary solutions\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"8604d0cb-3227-ad4f-b738-1611b2bb72de"],
 "\nUse symbolic reduction first. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"2. Linear stability\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"9d39aad7-bbce-164e-b17c-115469ef38a4"],
 "\nCompute the Jacobian / stiffness operator around equilibrium. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"3. Modal decomposition\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"9f70844e-816e-c841-888e-8f06397573e1"],
 "\nExtract eigenmodes and classify: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "stable"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"ac80c286-5d9f-e146-b35b-f9b7836f9f39"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "unstable"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"f9392611-5b12-d646-b0e4-2f3d47537072"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "neutral"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"7a7b495d-08ec-864d-bfa5-a68c22c84fd3"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  "oscillatory"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"9801b5c2-d857-534b-857a-22a818dcff3f"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"4. Observability / identifiability\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"112e44ac-22e5-e24b-b7d9-d62ef561bff3"],
 "\nDetermine which latent parameters can be recovered from measured outputs. \
\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"5. Residual analysis\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"bed3ce41-c090-174f-9040-44799e3b929b"],
 "\nCompare theory-induced constraints against observed or simulated data.\n\n\
This is how you search for the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]right computational \
path\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote]: not by metaphysical direct access, but by \
selecting models that survive all consistency filters. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"b228f02c-8d12-6145-9f5d-daadea61f3a7"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Philosophical point stated rigorously\"\>", "Title",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->26],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"9504dbb4-3bc1-454c-bb44-8452db584729"],
 "\nYou asked: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{
    {
     PaneBox["\<\"if we calculate it, is it already measured?\"\>",
      BaseStyle->{"Text", FontColor -> LightDarkSwitched[
          GrayLevel[0.35], 
          GrayLevel[0.8602474]]},
      ImageMargins->5,
      ImageSize->{Full, Automatic}]}
   },
   AutoDelete->False,
   GridBoxBackground->{"Columns" -> {{
        LightDarkSwitched[
         GrayLevel[1], 
         GrayLevel[0.278317]]}}},
   GridBoxDividers->{"ColumnsIndexed" -> {1 -> Directive[
         LightDarkSwitched[
          RGBColor[0.87, 0.94, 1], 
          RGBColor[0.2491127, 0.3295188, 0.4231198]], 
         AbsoluteThickness[4]]}, "Rows" -> {{False}}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Automatic}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}]], 
  "BlockQuote",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"814314f5-c5a0-a247-b4eb-90e42f6cdcea"],
 "\nIn a strict formal sense: ",
 StyleBox["yes, if it is represented as an evaluated element inside the \
observable algebra",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ".\n\nBut there is a deeper distinction: \n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  StyleBox["represented formally",
   FontWeight->Bold],
  " does not necessarily mean ",
  StyleBox["physically measured",
   FontWeight->Bold]
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"245da499-2763-a940-8254-4cf243524cc1"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  StyleBox["computed symbolically",
   FontWeight->Bold],
  " does not necessarily mean ",
  StyleBox["empirically collapsed",
   FontWeight->Bold]
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"6d366b6e-1894-404e-b6ab-e5b05e30f7ba"],
 "\n",
 Cell[TextData[{
  StyleBox["\[Bullet]",
   FontColor->LightDarkSwitched[
     GrayLevel[0.5], 
     GrayLevel[0.7533742]]],
  " ",
  StyleBox["defined implicitly",
   FontWeight->Bold],
  " may preserve nonconstructive openness"
 }], "InlineItem",ExpressionUUID->"cb64a9a7-c09c-4647-b288-084f8e0a39b0"],
 "\nSo the rigorous way to preserve \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]unmeasured \
possibility\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] is to represent it as: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"An implicit object, not an explicit evaluated value\"\>", 
    "Section",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False,
    FontSize->22],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"d2d5afe1-63fa-864f-8d09-d1949bc67ffe"],
 "\nExamples: \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Implicit constraint\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"bc923d9d-f207-934f-b4ee-62f742a0db4b"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         StyleBox["F", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"[", 
           RowBox[{"\[Xi]", ",", "\[Rho]", ",", "\[Chi]", ",", 
             StyleBox["R", "TI"]}], "]"}], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> "F[\\xi,\\rho,\\chi,R]=0",
      "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "e474b991-ce9b-1c45-9806-03a3d6ddefda"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Existential statement\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"d0efa567-61c7-164a-af54-062ce2255c55"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{"\[Exists]\[Xi]", "\[Element]", 
         StyleBox["X", "TI"], " such that ", 
         StyleBox["C", "TI"], 
         RowBox[{"(", 
           RowBox[{"\[Xi]", ",", "\[Rho]", ",", "\[Chi]", ",", 
             StyleBox["R", "TI"]}], ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", "0"}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\exists \\xi \\in \\mathcal{X} \\text{ such that } \
\\mathcal{C}(\\xi,\\rho,\\chi,R)=0", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "dfd725b3-f002-ea4a-9c74-37fa5368085a"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Equivalence class\"\>", "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"2dea0575-5d6c-6448-81c4-92af3bab1718"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          RowBox[{"[", "\[CapitalPsi]", "]"}], 
          StyleBox["M", "TI"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         RowBox[{"{", 
           RowBox[{"\[CapitalPhi]", ":", 
             StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", "\[CapitalPhi]", ")"}], "\[LongEqual]", 
             StyleBox["M", "TI"], 
             RowBox[{"(", "\[CapitalPsi]", ")"}]}], "}"}]}], TraditionalForm],
      "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "[\\Psi]_{\\mathcal{M}} = \\{\\Phi : \
\\mathcal{M}(\\Phi)=\\mathcal{M}(\\Psi)\\}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "ee74648c-0dd3-f647-9179-3a9161dd1977"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"Functional integral over latent possibilities\"\>", 
    "Subsection",
    CellFrame->0,
    ShowStringCharacters->False],
   ImageMargins->{{0, 0}, {5, 15}}]], "InlineSection",
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"0dc019b7-11a6-b74c-ae4c-1b8909564a7f"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   TemplateBox[<|"boxes" -> FormBox[
       RowBox[{
         SubscriptBox[
          StyleBox["O", "TI"], 
          StyleBox["eff", FontSlant -> "Plain"]], "\[LongEqual]", 
         "\[Integral]", 
         StyleBox["D", "TI"], "\[Xi] ", 
         SuperscriptBox[
          StyleBox["e", "TI"], 
          RowBox[{"-", 
            StyleBox["S", "TI"], 
            RowBox[{"[", 
              RowBox[{"\[Rho]", ",", "\[Chi]", ",", 
                StyleBox["R", "TI"], ",", "\[Xi]"}], "]"}]}]]}], 
       TraditionalForm], "errors" -> {}, "input" -> 
     "\\mathcal{O}_{\\mathrm{eff}}\n=\n\\int \\mathcal{D}\\xi \\; \
e^{-S[\\rho,\\chi,R,\\xi]}", "state" -> "Boxes"|>,
    "TeXAssistantTemplate"], TraditionalForm]],ExpressionUUID->
  "f31728e3-3778-2c4f-892d-23b317e805e5"],
 "\nThis is exactly how physics already handles inaccessible sectors in a \
rigorous way. \n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TagBox[GridBox[{
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]},
     {
      TemplateBox[{0},
       "Spacer1"]}
    },
    AutoDelete->False,
    FrameStyle->Directive[
      LightDarkSwitched[
       GrayLevel[0.8], 
       GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
      AbsoluteThickness[1]],
    GridBoxDividers->{
     "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
    GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
   "Grid"]], "MarkdownDelimiter",
  ShowStringCharacters->False,
  Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"f06e4470-d32d-994c-b922-3569056c87f8"],
 "\n",
 Cell[BoxData[
  PaneBox[
   StyleBox["\<\"The most correct conceptual move\"\>", "Title",
    CellFrame->0,
