     LightDarkSwitched[
      GrayLevel[0.8], 
      GrayLevel[0.4867756]], 
     AbsoluteThickness[1]],
   GridBoxDividers->{
    "Columns" -> {False, {True}, False}, "Rows" -> {False, {True}, False}},
   GridBoxItemSize->{"Columns" -> {{Fit}}, "Rows" -> {{Automatic}}}],
  "Grid"]], "Text", "MarkdownDelimiter",
 ShowStringCharacters->False,
 Background->None,ExpressionUUID->"d6a5ac46-fcd3-7f40-aea1-5bb643ca8500"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["13. What this notebook establishes rigorously", "Section",ExpressionUUID->"1fb05697-1099-ca44-a97f-3f00596fe9f4"],

Cell["\<\
the original written Layer 1 action has a trivial stationary point\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"7f692890-c539-e04e-825e-f43fe7c427de"],

Cell["\<\
nontrivial PDE structure requires additional derivative or constraint terms\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"ed6d6495-2ab4-a844-8d24-811c708d0c3d"],

Cell["\<\
a symbolic variational pipeline can be built cleanly in Wolfram Language\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"acc26eec-bdee-d348-8ae2-2ca98b2178bc"],

Cell["\<\
the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]stable frequency\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] request \
requires explicit time dynamics\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"0b9b18a5-da94-774c-b338-4ed111e4947c"],

Cell["the Layer 2 maintenance operator is solvable exactly", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"03fae8d2-91d6-7b40-b22c-01278de11000"],

Cell["\<\
the framework can already be made modular, visual, and testable without \
hiding assumptions\
\>", "Item",ExpressionUUID->"1d98680f-2888-6f49-834f-96ea61300c18"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "If you want, the next notebook should be ",
 StyleBox["RHUFT Test 2: Hyperbolic Extension for True Resonance Spectrum",
  FontWeight->Bold],
 ", where we add time-kinetic terms and derive actual dispersion relations."
}], "Text",ExpressionUUID->"aaf1328d-9ad6-6949-a414-df7630df92e9"]
}, Open  ]]
}, Open  ]]
},
